@startuml STM-5_CreditAccount
!include _style.iuml
title STM-5 CreditAccount\ncredit_accounts.status · v0.3 · 24/10/2026 · confirmed by Khang
[*] --> active : driver account created
active --> in_shortfall : session debit\n[balance < 0]\n/ block new csms_billed starts
in_shortfall --> active : top-up credited\n[balance ≥ 0]
active --> closed : driver requests closure in app\n[balance ≥ 0, no open top-up, no running session]\n/ refund entry, refund listed for Admin (UC-ADM-08)
closed --> [*]
note right of in_shortfall
  Closing is refused while in_shortfall.
  Closure: driver request in the app (UC-ACC-02);
  Admin executes the gateway refund (UC-ADM-08).
end note
@enduml
